212
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:45,254
The lab gives you a state and asks you to
fill in a table before you run anything:

213
00:16:45,294 --> 00:16:51,214
for each of --soft, --mixed, --hard, --keep
and --merge, the content of HEAD, the

214
00:16:51,254 --> 00:16:55,628
index and the working tree, and
the output of git status -s.

215
00:16:55,668 --> 00:17:01,515
Fill in the whole table first. Then run
the commands and mark every cell you got

216
00:17:01,555 --> 00:17:01,956
wrong.

217
00:17:02,296 --> 00:17:06,540
For the failure scenario, predict which of
